# Working on {{ vars.product_name }}

Follow the {{ kitchen.house }} house rules for Tauri applications.

- Pair every `#[tauri::command]` with `#[specta::specta]` and regenerate the
  TypeScript bindings with `just bindings` after changing a command.
- Keep plugin state in `State<'_, T>`; do not use global statics.
- Run `just check` before publishing. Releases go through the release
  workflow only.
